OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 DEC
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GNil Venditti conducts Royal
OL,9,     GNorthern Sinfonia in Beethoven's
OL,10,     Giconic Symphony No. 5, and Boris
OL,11,     GGiltburg is the soloist in
OL,12,     GChopin's Piano Concerto No. 2.
OL,13,G2145FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,14,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,15,     Gsounds and stories of 5 female
OL,16,     Gelectronic pioneers. Tonight
OL,17,     GDelia Derbyshire a creator close
OL,18,     Gto Hannah's heart who brought the
OL,19,     Gtheme from Dr Who to life.
